{% include "@components/navigation-prototypes/navbar-tooth.twig" %}

<section class="grid-container">
    <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x align-center">
        <div class="cell large-8 medium-8 small-12">
            <p>The TOOTH Project provides training to teachers that will improve their students’ oral health.</p>
            <p>This study is important because:
                <div class="indent-list">
                    <ul>
                        <li>Extremely high level of dental diseases in Texas</li>
                        <li>Almost 50% of kindergarten children has cavities</li>
                        <li>1 in 6 children have untreated tooth decay</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </p>
            <p>Students might visit a dentist only once a year or over a year, which is why elementary school teachers are important as teachers work with students on a regular basis, and educating students at an early age helps them establish good healthy behaviors that will last a lifetime.</p>
            <p>In our survery, we are evaluating:
                <div class="indent-list">
                    <ul>
                        <li>Teachers’ current knowledge of oral health</li>
                        <li>Teachers' opinions of the training</li>
                        <li>Teachers' opinions of the students’ curriculum </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </p>
            <p>Dental disease is caused by dental plaque (gum disease and cavities) and a sugary diet (cavities). The impact of oral diseases in children can result in pain and suffering, missing school, parents missing work, malnutrition, and aggressive behavior. </p>

            <p>We can prevent oral diseases by:
                <div class="indent-list">
                    <ul>
                        <li>Proper oral hygiene</li>
                        <li>Controlling what you eat (sugary products)</li>
                        <li>Fluoride (toothpaste and dentist)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </p>
            <div class="grid-x">
                <div class="cell large-9 medium-9 small-12">
                    <div class="orbit" role="region" aria-label="children with dental diseases" data-orbit>
                        <div class="orbit-wrapper">
                            <div class="orbit-controls">
                            <button class="orbit-previous"><span class="show-for-sr">Previous Slide</span>&#9664;&#xFE0E;</button>
                            <button class="orbit-next"><span class="show-for-sr">Next Slide</span>&#9654;&#xFE0E;</button>
                            </div>
                            <ul class="orbit-container">
                            <li class="is-active orbit-slide">
                                <figure class="orbit-figure">
                                    <img class="orbit-image" src="../../images/dental-disease-1.jpg" alt="placeholder">
                                    <figcaption class="orbit-caption">Optional caption for image</figcaption>
                                </figure>
                            </li>
                            <li class="orbit-slide">
                                <figure class="orbit-figure">
                                    <img class="orbit-image" src="../../images/dental-disease-2.jpg" alt="">
                                    <figcaption class="orbit-caption">Optional caption for image</figcaption>
                                </figure>
                            </li>
                            <li class="orbit-slide">
                                <figure class="orbit-figure">
                                    <img class="orbit-image" src="../../images/dental-disease-3.jpg" alt="">
                                    <figcaption class="orbit-caption">Optional caption for image</figcaption>
                                </figure>
                            </li>
                            <li class="orbit-slide">
                                <figure class="orbit-figure">
                                    <img class="orbit-image" src="../../images/dental-disease-4.jpg" alt="">
                                    <figcaption class="orbit-caption">Optional caption for image</figcaption>
                                </figure>
                            </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <nav class="orbit-bullets">
                            <button class="is-active" data-slide="0">
                            <span class="show-for-sr">First slide details</span>
                            <span class="show-for-sr" data-slide-active-label>Current Slide</span>
                            </button>
                            <button data-slide="1"><span class="show-for-sr">Second slide details</span></button>
                            <button data-slide="2"><span class="show-for-sr">Third slide details</span></button>
                            <button data-slide="3"><span class="show-for-sr">Fourth slide details</span></button>
                        </nav>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
        </div>
        <div class="cell large-4 medium-4 small-12">
